    "preferred": "Acer palmatum dissectum 'Green Gem' Green Laceleaf Green Gem Japanese Maple Zones 5-9 ‘Green Gem’ is a newer selection of weeping laceleaf Japanese maple by Talon Buchholz. The finely cut foliage and low spreading weeping habit seem quite distinctive. Fall color range from bright red to deeper dark red. We expect 'Green Gem' to reach 3-4 ft in height by 5-6 ft in width in 10 years."
